# What a `docker build` with modules/documents as its context must not send. Only the generation
# worker builds from here (generation/worker/Dockerfile); the Docling image's context is
# processing/, with its own ignore files.
#
# Keep this and .maven-dockerignore identical, for the reason processing/.dockerignore gives.
# The Dockerfile names every file it copies, so this only keeps the context small: processing's
# .venv alone is ~100 MB.
api/
**/target/
**/.venv/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/src/test/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
